{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can craft a fascinating, surprising, and memorable life story with the simplest operation\u2014just choosing one card per turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter many challenges as well as opportunities. Seize those opportunities and overcome seemingly difficult challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examples of in-game combos:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically synthesizing materials to build a rocket.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393750/extras/e8c5751eaaa294122c8cf66afd68eec8.poster.avif?t=1770173333\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393750/extras/e8c5751eaaa294122c8cf66afd68eec8.webm?t=1770173333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393750/extras/e8c5751eaaa294122c8cf66afd68eec8.mp4?t=1770173333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrorist attacks happening worldwide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393750/extras/3c073864557b2bcf10faeb37e778520d.poster.avif?t=1770173333\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393750/extras/3c073864557b2bcf10faeb37e778520d.webm?t=1770173333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393750/extras/3c073864557b2bcf10faeb37e778520d.mp4?t=1770173333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different gameplay styles waiting for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For instance, as you age, you'll need to face various [stages] of choices, where different decisions could completely alter your life's trajectory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter various [events] that could either bring you benefits or present challenges you must overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your [badges] level up, the choices and gameplay in life will become even more diverse or take a different turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and enjoy playing out your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to contact us, you can join our QQ group: 817959767.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u65e9\u592d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393750/2692585fccd62539778871e65e6883b25daea34d.jpg"},{"name":"\u767e\u5c81\u8001\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393750/dd477366f94902ba0ba01c4bb399e5cc1c74d86f.jpg"},{"name":"\u7a77\u56f0\u6f66\u5012","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393750/72a42bf55af462f8ebeb366a507dd7340d7950d7.jpg"},{"name":"\u5fc3\u529b\u6194\u60b4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393750/ed2737b6c2af9c463d676288e2f6b0c39cb49cb2.jpg"},{"name":"\u90c1\u90c1\u800c\u7ec8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393750/607265d8e1d786642a9822ee948e192b3fa9cd9d.jpg"},{"name":"\u6211\u7684\u4eba\u751f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393750/85dc78c1777bdb3b0c794eb8611e0ec0a1861701.jpg"},{"name":"\u5f53\u4ee3\u8fbe\u82ac\u5947","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393750/b18992fff5c57bb83c3dee81d7fcff